    <name>Machines: Wired For War</name>
    <summary>A true classic 3D RTS from the late 90s</summary>
    <description>
        <p>
            Community fork of a 3D Real-Time Strategy video game from 1999 developed by Charybdis and released as free software by Night Dive Studios.
        </p>
        <p>The most notable changes are:<p>
        <ul>
            <li>Added support for 2X UI scaling</li>
            <li>Added support for WASD camera and machines in-head control</li>
            <li>Added more keyboard shortcuts</li>
            <li>Added initial support for mods (most notable is German localization)</li>
            <li>Fixed various LAN game issues</li>
            <li>Fixed tens of bugs</li>
            <li>Fixed a dozen of crashes</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
            Note: The application requires original game assets.
            In case of Flatpak installation the files (top-level `machines` directory) should be placed at <code>~/.var/app/io.github.wiredforwar.machines/data/</code>.
        </p>
    </description>
    <developer>
        <name>Wired for War</name>
    </developer>
